boolean:auto_levelup_enabled.description:
Automatically change your `Training promotion level` preference to next level once you passed with `Pass: Retake Recommendation` or higher.
- Changes your `Training promotion level` preference even if it's is unset;
- Using with `Rejoin training queue automatically` preference will attempt to change your `Training promotion level` preference before rejoining;
- Will not change anything if you are retaking level.
